{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And I will meet.</b> I do not understand how this verse can be reconciled with the verse \"And YHWH spoke to him from the Tent of Meeting, saying\" (Leviticus 1:1), for there, \"Tent of Meeting\" includes the entire Tabernacle and all that is in it, and there is no need for a decisive ruling." "And the reason for the vav in ואת כל אשר אצוה is that the word ודברתי serves on account of another, as though it were written: \"And I will speak with you from above the cover, from between the two cherubim,\" and the thing spoken was not mentioned. The sense is: I will speak with you to make known My secrets and to answer your question; and ודברתי את כל אשר אצוה — all that I will command you concerning the children of Israel. And one may ask why HaShem mentioned the ark first, for it is written \"the pattern of the Tabernacle and the pattern of all its vessels\" (above, verse 9). But the usage of the language is to specify the last item, with which it concluded, as in \"And I gave to Isaac Jacob and Esau, and I gave to Esau\" (Joshua 24:4). Therefore He began and specified the vessels of the Tabernacle, starting from the most honored, then the table and the menorah, and afterward \"And the Tabernacle you shall make.\" And note: when Moses assembled all the congregation, he began by telling them first the Tabernacle and the Tent, and afterward the ark; and there is no need for anyone to instruct Moses. And one may wonder why the incense altar was not mentioned. The answer is by way of parable: the Glory does not depart, therefore the ark is the image of a throne; and the menorah and table are set before it. Therefore He did not mention the incense altar except after the altar of burnt offering, because He needed to warn: \"You shall not offer on it a burnt-offering or a meal-offering or a libation\" (below, 30:9). And Moses mentioned it to the children of Israel after the menorah, and so too in the making."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:26.838075789Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}